  "payload": {
    "rawResponseText": "An owner converting an existing **upper-upscale** hotel asset in North America should usually look first at the major **upper-upscale, conversion-friendly brands** from Marriott, Hilton, Hyatt, IHG, Wyndham, Sonesta, Accor, Best Western, Choice, and Margaritaville, because those brands are commonly positioned in the upper-upscale tier and are active in North America.[4][5][7]\n\nThe most relevant brands to consider include:\n\n- **Marriott**: Marriott Hotels, Sheraton, Westin, Le Méridien, Renaissance, Autograph Collection, Delta Hotels, Tribute Portfolio, and Gaylord.[7][14]\n- **Hilton**: Hilton Hotels & Resorts, Signia by Hilton, Curio Collection, DoubleTree by Hilton, Embassy Suites by Hilton, and Canopy by Hilton.[7][4][11]\n- **Hyatt**: Hyatt Regency, Hyatt, Grand Hyatt, Thompson Hotels, Destination by Hyatt, The Unbound Collection by Hyatt, and JdV by Hyatt.[7]\n- **IHG**: Crowne Plaza, HUALUXE, Hotel Indigo, EVEN Hotels, and voco.[7][10]\n- **Wyndham**: Wyndham Grand and Dolce by Wyndham.[7][9]\n- **Accor**: Pullman, Swissôtel, Mövenpick, MGallery, and Novotel.[7]\n- **Sonesta**: Royal Sonesta and The James.[7]\n- **Best Western**: WorldHotels Elite and WorldHotels Distinctive.[7]\n- **Choice**: Radisson Blu and, in some scale references, Radisson.[7][4][5]\n- **Margaritaville**: Margaritaville Hotels & Resorts.[2][3][7]\n\nIf the asset is especially strong on lifestyle design or wants a softer flag, the most often cited **upper-upscale soft-brand / collection-style options** are **Autograph Collection, Curio Collection, Tapestry Collection, Tribute Portfolio, The Unbound Collection, JdV by Hyatt, and WorldHotels**.[7][14]\n\nA practical short list for an owner would be:\n\n- **Marriott** if the property can support a broad business-transient and group mix.[7][19]\n- **Hilton** if the asset fits a strong select-service-to-full-service conversion path and benefits from reservation-system scale.[7][11]\n- **Hyatt** if the hotel is in a strong urban or lifestyle market and can justify a higher guest-experience profile.[7]\n- **IHG** if the property fits a mainstream upper-upscale conversion with broad corporate demand.[7][10]\n- **Curio / Autograph / Tribute Portfolio / Unbound Collection** if the hotel’s existing identity is distinctive and should be preserved.[7][14]\n\nIf you want, I can also turn this into a **brand-by-brand conversion fit matrix** showing which brands are best for **urban, resort, convention, lifestyle, or extended-stay upper-upscale assets**.",
